        "\n",
        "## Linear Program `pyomo` Example {.theme-slide6}\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\begin{array}{ll}\n",
        "  \\min       & 2 x_1 + 3 x_2\\\\\n",
        "  \\mathrm{s.t.} & 3 x_1 + 4 x_2 \\geq 1\\\\\n",
        "             & x_1, x_2 \\geq 0\n",
        "\\end{array}\n",
        "$$"
      ],
